{
  "name": "dsh-porthole",
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "description": "DSH 本机门户：反代 + 双密码门禁 + 会话投影剥离 + 远程工作区管理，支持 nginx 子域名或二级目录。",
  "releaseNotes": "【v1.3.0】① 新增「反向代理接入」面板：可视化配置 basePath（nginx 二级目录）与监听地址 host，basePath 保存即生效、host 变更触发代理重启，均持久化到 config.json 且优先于 cordis.yml；② 面板页脚恢复版本号显示（升级后是否真的生效，一眼可查）；③ 支持 nginx 二级目录反代：修正扫码直通 302 的 Location 与会话 Cookie Path，登录页改用相对路径；④ 安全修复：回环免密原先允许 Host 为空，nginx 漏配 proxy_set_header Host 时会导致全站免密；⑤ 修 port=0 时未回填实际监听端口；⑥ 端点前缀与 Cookie 名统一为 porthole / dsh_portal_auth。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./locale/*": "./locale/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "GAP-REPORT.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build:client": "node client/build.mjs",
    "prepack": "npm run build:client",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "qrcode": "^1.5.3"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.1"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
